Package: tennisage
Type: Package
Title: Career Matches and Age Gaps of Tennis Players from Tennis Abstract
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ash", "Htet", email = "h.ash@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads the career matches of a professional tennis player
    from tennisabstract.com, computes the age of the player and of each
    opponent on the day of the match, and draws a scatter plot of the age
    difference against the player's age, similar to a New York Times graphic
    about Serena Williams.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, httr2, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
